      <p class="tagline">A diagnostic for Model Context Protocol servers.<br>Runs on your machine. Your credentials never leave it.</p>
      <p class="link">satellion.com</p>
    </div>
    <div class="colo-notes">
      <p><strong>How to read this.</strong> Every finding above is tied to a request passmcp
      made; nothing is reported as passing without one. Where a finding cites an exchange,
      the full request and response are in the telemetry written beside this file.</p>
      <p><strong>Sharing.</strong> Secrets are masked structurally at the recorder — headers
      by name, credentials by value, including tokens this server issued during the run — so
      this document is safe to circulate.</p>
      <p class="fine">passmcp {{ .Report.Passmcp.Version }} · report schema v{{ .Report.Passmcp.SchemaVersion }} · trace {{ .Report.TraceID }}<br>
      Generated {{ .Started }} · GPL-3.0-only · no telemetry was sent in producing this report</p>
    </div>
  </div>
